 Casus, die Endung des ersten Casus; Du. die beiden ersten Casus, die Endungen der b. e. C.\n— 6〉 n. Sg. collect. die Ersten."}]}]}],"praTamaka":[{"id":"praTamaka","headword":"प्रथमक","headword_slp1":"praTamaka","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"प्रथमक Adj. der erste."}]}]}],"praTamakalpa":[{"id":"praTamakalpa","headword":"प्रथमकल्प","headword_slp1":"praTamakalpa","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"प्रथमकल्प m. eine primäre, zuerst zu erfüllende Vorschrift "},{"t":"cite","s":"M. 11,30","q":"M"},{"t":"txt","s":"."}]}]}],"praTamakalpika":[{"id":"praTamakalpika","headword":"प्रथमकल्पिक","headword_slp1":"praTamakalpika","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"प्रथमकल्पिक m. Bez. eines Yogin auf der ersten Stufe Comm. zu "},{"t":"cite","s":"YOGAS. 3,50","q":"YOGAS"},{"t":"txt","s":". Vgl. प्राथम˚."}]}]},{"id":"prATamakalpika","headword":"प्राथमकल्पिक","headword_slp1":"prATamakalpika","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"— 1〉 Adj.\n — a〉 vor Allen —, im strengsten Sinne des Wortes Etwas seiend.\n — b〉 Bez. eines Yogin auf der ersten Stufe Vgl. प्रथम˚.\n— 2〉 m. Anfänger, ein beginnender Schüler "},{"t":"cite","s":"MAHĀBH. 5,28","q":"MAHĀBH"},{"t":"txt","s":",b."}]},{"n":2,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"प्राथमकल्पिक "},{"t":"cite","s":"IV. 1","q":""},{"t":"txt","s":"〉a〉 auch v. l. "},{"t":"cite","s":"M. 9,166","q":"M"},{"t":"txt","s":"."}]}]}],"praTamakalpita":[{"id":"praTamakalpita","headword":"प्रथमकल्पित","headword_slp1":"praTamakalpita","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"प्रथमकल्पित Adj. obenanstehend 198,22. "},{"t":"cite","s":"MBH. 13,87,6. 14,3,17","q":"MBH"},{"t":"txt","s":"."}]}]}],"praTamakusuma":[{"id":"praTamakusuma","headword":"प्रथमकुसुम","headword_slp1":"praTamakusuma","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"*प्रथमकुसुम weisser Majoran."}]}]}],"praTamagarBa":[{"id":"praTamagarBa","headword":"प्रथमगर्भ","headword_slp1":"praTamagarBa","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"प्रथमगर्भ m. die erste Schwangerschaft, — Trach